<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n271" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθ-ύνω</span></b> , first and freq. in <i><span class="en">
			LXX
		</span></i>: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>honour, magnify,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				1.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ps.</u>
				50(51).18
			</span></i>: <i>adorn,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κεφαλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>4 Ki.</u>
					9.30
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cheer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθυνάτω σε ἡ καρδία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ec.</u>
					11.9
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be of good cheer, rejoice greatly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ki.</u>
				13.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Da.</u>
				6.23
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make good,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				707.11
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				13
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				122
			</span></i>: 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Epict.</u>
				p.6D.
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>make beneficent,</i> in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Doroth.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				2.196
			</span></i>, Jul.Laod.ib. <i><span class="en">
				4.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>do good to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heliod.
					<u>in EN</u>
					86.41
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>do good, do well,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ps.</u>
				35(36).3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>
			) to one, ib.<i><span class="en">
				124(125).4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
